{"id":"41a013de8d6bab9d","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-game2-closed-game.md","title":"ZFC Game2 Closed Game","display":"df-zfc-game2-closed-game — ZFC Game2 Closed Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game2-closed-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game2-closed-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game2-closed-game — ZFC Game2 Closed Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game2-closed-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game2-closed-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game2-closed-game — ZFC Game2 Closed Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,A,x,y,n\\in V\">\\(P,A,x,y,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2ClosedGame}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2ClosedGame}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}closed\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2ClosedGame}_S(P,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land P\\subseteq A^\\omega\\land\\forall x\\in A^\\omega\\setminus P\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall y\\in A^\\omega\\;(y\\upharpoonright n=x\\upharpoonright n\\to y\\notin P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}closed\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2ClosedGame}_S(P,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land P\\subseteq A^\\omega\\land\\forall x\\in A^\\omega\\setminus P\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall y\\in A^\\omega\\;(y\\upharpoonright n=x\\upharpoonright n\\to y\\notin P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,A,x,y,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2ClosedGame}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}closed\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame2ClosedGame}_S(P,A)\\leftrightarrow A\\neq\\emptyset\\land P\\subseteq A^\\omega\\land\\forall x\\in A^\\omega\\setminus P\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall y\\in A^\\omega\\;(y\\upharpoonright n=x\\upharpoonright n\\to y\\notin P)","display":true}],"bytes":750,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-game2-closed-game.md|58-df-zfc-game2-closed-game]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}